ro\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE GUIDE LIBRARY</span><h1>Practical guides for<br/><em>personal websites.</em></h1><p>Find useful ideas and step-by-step tutorials for making a birthday wish website, proposal page, digital invitation or personal message with Wishly.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"page-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"guide-toolbar\"><div class=\"filter-label\">Explore all tutorials and how-to articles</div><label class=\"search-box\"><span class=\"skip-link\">Search guides</span><input aria-label=\"Search guides\" data-guide-search=\"\" placeholder=\"Search guides…\" type=\"search\"/></label></div><div class=\"guide-grid\"><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to create a personal wish website with wishly a practical walkthrough: choose a template, personalize its content, preview the experience and publish one shareable link. start here\" href=\"/guides/create-wish-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"How to Create a Personal Wish Website with Wishly\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/wishly-personal-wish-website-maker.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Start here</span><h3>How to Create a Personal Wish Website with Wishly</h3><p>A practical walkthrough: choose a template, personalize its content, preview the experience and publish one shareable link.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>6 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"birthday wish website ideas that feel personal plan a birthday page with a memorable opening, a warm message, photos and thoughtful details that suit the person. birthday ideas\" href=\"/guides/birthday-wish-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Birthday Wish Website Ideas That Feel Personal\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/birthday-wish-website-preview.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Birthday ideas</span><h3>Birthday Wish Website Ideas That Feel Personal</h3><p>Plan a birthday page with a memorable opening, a warm message, photos and thoughtful details that suit the person.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>5 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to make a romantic proposal website turn your story into a gentle online proposal with a clear narrative, meaningful memories and a thoughtful final question. proposal guide\" href=\"/guides/proposal-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"How to Make a Romantic Proposal Website\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/online-proposal-website.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Proposal guide</span><h3>How to Make a Romantic Proposal Website</h3><p>Turn your story into a gentle online proposal with a clear narrative, meaningful memories and a thoughtful final question.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>5 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><aside aria-label=\"Advertisements\" class=\"ad-slot\" data-ad-key=\"guide-index\"><span class=\"ad-label\">Advertisements</span><div class=\"ad-render\"></div></aside><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to change a wishly template’s theme and font use template-specific design settings to choose a color palette, set a custom color and select a font. design settings\" href=\"/guides/theme-font-settings/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"How to Change a Wishly Template’s Theme and Font\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/wishly-builder-design-settings.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Design settings</span><h3>How to Change a Wishly Template’s Theme and Font</h3><p>Use template-specific design settings to choose a color palette, set a custom color and select a font.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>4 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to share a wishly website with a personal link preview understand link previews and learn how to add a title, description and image before sharing your published page. sharing tips\" href=\"/guides/share-wish-website-link/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"How to Share a Wishly Website with a Personal Link Preview\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/wishly-link-preview-guide.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Sharing tips</span><h3>How to Share a Wishly Website with a Personal Link Preview</h3><p>Understand link previews and learn how to add a title, description and image before sharing your published page.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>4 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"anniversary website ideas create a personal page shared timeline photographs letter\" href=\"/guides/anniversary-website-ideas/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Anniversary website inspiration\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/anniversary-surprise-website.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Anniversary ideas</span><h3>Anniversary Website Ideas for Your Story</h3><p>Plan a personal timeline, choose meaningful photographs and write an anniversary letter.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>7 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"digital love letter website create heartfelt online letter photos words\" href=\"/guides/digital-love-letter-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Digital love letter guide\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/digital-love-letter-guide.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Digital letters</span><h3>Create a Digital Love Letter Website</h3><p>Turn your words, photographs and memories into a thoughtful online letter.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>7 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"wedding invitation website online invitation event details schedule rsvp\" href=\"/guides/wedding-invitation-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Wedding invitation website guide\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/wedding-story-website.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Wedding invitations</span><h3>Wedding Invitation Website Guide</h3><p>Organize names, venue details, event schedules and guest instructions.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>7 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"birthday website message ideas write personal birthday wishes meaningful words\" href=\"/guides/birthday-website-message-ideas/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Birthday website message ideas\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/birthday-website-how-to.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Birthday writing</span><h3>Birthday Website Message Ideas</h3><p>Write a birthday wish with memories, gratitude and words that sound like you.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>7 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"friendship website ideas best friend surprise shared memories photo timeline thank you page\" href=\"/guides/friendship-website-ideas/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Friendship website ideas for a personal surprise page\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/friendship-surprise-website.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Friendship ideas</span><h3>Friendship Website Ideas for Your Best Friend</h3><p>Build a page around shared memories, inside jokes, favourite photos and an honest note of appreciation.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>7 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"apology website guide sincere apology page accountability personal message boundaries\" href=\"/guides/apology-website-guide/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Thoughtful apology website guide\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/sorry-website-guide.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Apology guide</span><h3>How to Make a Thoughtful Apology Website</h3><p>Plan a sincere message with accountability, clear words and respectful boundaries.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>7 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"thank you website ideas appreciation teacher parent mentor friend team personal page\" href=\"/guides/thank-you-website-guide/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Thank-you website ideas and personal appreciation page\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/thank-you-website-guide.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Thank-you ideas</span><h3>Thank-You Website Ideas for Someone Special</h3><p>Turn appreciation into a personal page with specific memories, photographs and a thoughtful message.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>6 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n<a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"personal website without coding no code website maker template publish mobile preview share\" href=\"/guides/personal-website-without-coding/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Personal website maker and no-code website creation guide\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/wishly-personal-wish-website-maker.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">No-code tutorial</span><h3>How to Make a Personal Website Without Coding</h3><p>A practical walkthrough from choosing a builder and preparing content to previewing and sharing a page.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>8 min read</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a>\n</div><div class=\"empty-state\">No guides match that search yet. Try another word.</div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer hp-foot\">\n      <div class=\"premium-container\">\n        <div class=\"hp-foot-row footer-main-row\">\n          <div class=\"hp-foot-brand\">\n            <a aria-label=\"Wishly Guide home\" class=\"brand-lockup brand\" href=\"/\">\n              <span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"brand-lockup-copy\"><b>Wishly</b><small>GUIDE · CREATE MOMENTS</small></span>\n            </a>\n            <p>Ideas, practical tutorials and clear answers for creating personal websites that make life’s special moments feel even more memorable.</p>\n            <a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost footer-main-cta\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Main Wishly website ↗</a>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"/guides/\">All guides</a><a href=\"/features/\">Wishly features</a><a href=\"/faq/\">Frequently asked</a><a href=\"/about/\">About Wishly</a></div>\n          <div class=\"footer-link-group\"><h4>Wishly</h4><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Main Wishly website ↗</a><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/templates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Browse templates ↗</a><a href=\"https://wishly.bd/